WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.537
Mr. Jay doesn't want children who memorise English.

00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:06.037
He wants children who can explain in English.

00:00:07.058 --> 00:00:09.183
So every lesson starts with a story.

00:00:09.183 --> 00:00:14.633
Children read closely, find clues, and every child says why, out loud.

00:00:15.638 --> 00:00:19.689
For ages five to eight, he runs a small Story Club: up to six

00:00:19.689 --> 00:00:24.138
children, once a week, with personal feedback on each child's work.

00:00:25.154 --> 00:00:29.041
Thirty minutes on Google Meet, and lessons are never recorded.

00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:33.799
Ask about a place: message Mr. Jay on Zalo: VIDEO.

